HappyWasp Restaurant
- Grab Food - $20
	if {Global.player_money} >= 20:
		Would you like to eat?
		- Yes
			do Global.set_hunger_to_max()
			set {Global.player_money} -= 20
			Your hunger has been filled
			do Global.use_action()
		- No
	else:
		You don't have enough money
- Work a shift
	You work as a waiter for the restaurant
	set {temp_money} = range(40,71).pick_random()
	set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
	You made {temp_money} money
	Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
	set {shifts_worked} += 1
	if {shifts_worked} == 5:
		The manager notices your hard work.
		They reward you with a catalytic converter from the back!
		do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
	do Global.use_action()
- Sleep
	You decided to lock yourself in the bathroom and sleep.
	do Global.change_resolve(20)
	do Global.sleep()
- Leave